  "label": "Concept of Jewish ethnicity and religion",
  "description": "The meme targets Jewish people based on their ethnicity and religion. The visual of a young girl holding the Israeli flag is used to imply that Jewish identity is tied to a specific national or ethnic group, which is a common antisemitic trope. This requires understanding of Jewish identity as a complex, multifaceted concept that is often misrepresented in hate speech.",
